---
import { url } from '../../lib/url';

interface Props {
  h1: string;
}

const { h1 } = Astro.props;
---
  <h1 class="page-title">{h1}</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">Backend Developer &middot; B.Sc. in Computer Systems (UNLa)</p>

<img src={url("images/style/mi cara.webp")} 
     alt="Franco Figueroa" 
     class="img-fluid float-end w-25 ms-3 mb-3 img-profile" width="600" height="450">

<h4 id="introduccion">Introduction <i class="fas fa-user"></i> </h4>
Hi, I'm Franco Figueroa, a Computer Systems graduate from the National University of Lanús (UNLa).
I am currently taking my first steps in the IT job market.
This is my portfolio, where I show my skills as a developer and my experience through different projects.
<br>
<p>
Beyond the projects shown here, I also build custom software and programs for each client's specific needs and requests.
I like listening to ideas and turning them into practical technological solutions, adapted to each particular situation.
</p>



<h4 id="habilidades">My skills <i class="fas fa-code"></i> </h4>
My strongest area is NodeJS on the backend, but I can also hold my own on the frontend using EJS.
The framework I use for my web projects is Express. I usually use MySQL for databases, but
if needed I know a bit of MongoDB. Here is a short summary of my skills:
<br>

<div class="row">

     <div class="col-4 skill-card">
          <strong>Backend skills</strong> <br>
          NodeJS <i class="fab fa-node-js"></i> <br>
          SQL/MySQL <i class="fas fa-database"></i> <br>
          Python, C++ <i class="fab fa-python"></i> <i class="fa-solid fa-c"></i> <br>
          Docker <i class="fa-brands fa-docker"></i> <br>
     </div>

    <div class="col-4 skill-card">
          <strong>Frontend skills</strong> <br>
          HTML5 <i class="fab fa-html5"></i>, CSS3 <i class="fab fa-css3-alt"></i> <br>
          Bootstrap <i class="fab fa-bootstrap"></i>, Font Awesome <i class="fab fa-font-awesome"></i> <br>
          EJS <br>
          React <i class="fab fa-react"></i><br>
    </div>

    <div class="col-4 skill-card">
          <strong>Soft skills</strong> <br>
          Native Spanish <i class="fi fi-es"></i> <br>
          English C1 <i class="fi fi-gb"></i> <br>
          Communication <br>
          Creativity applied to data analysis <br>
    </div>

</div>
<br>


<h4>English certificate</h4>
<div class="pdf-link">
  <a href={url("certificados/EF SET Certificate.pdf")} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf fa-2x" style="color:#dc3545;"></i>
    <span>View certificate PDF</span>
  </a>
</div>
<br>

<h4 id="contacto">My contact details <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> </h4>
<div class="row">

     <div class="col-4 contact-card">
          <h6>Email</h6>
          <img alt="" 
               src={url("images/style/email.webp")} 
               class="contact-icon border border-dark border-1" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
          >
          <span class="email"></span>
     </div>

     <div class="col-4 contact-card">
          <h6>Linkedin</h6>
          <img alt="" 
               src={url("images/style/linkedin.webp")} 
               class="contact-icon border border-dark border-1" width="160" height="160" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
          >
          <a 
               href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/franco-ariel-figueroa-746678363" 
               target="_blank" 
               rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
               View LinkedIn account
          </a>
     </div>

     <div class="col-4 contact-card">
          <h6>Curriculum Vitae</h6>
          <img alt="" 
               src={url("images/style/cv.webp")} 
               class="contact-icon border border-dark border-1" width="474" height="474" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
          >
          <a 
               href={url("cv/CV - Franco Ariel Figueroa.pdf")} 
               target="_blank" 
               rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
               View CV
          </a>
     </div>

</div>

<br>


